    "sub_name": "大數據概念與應用",
    "sub_ename": "PRINCIPLE AND APPLICATION OF BIG DATA",
    "describe_ch": "本課程擬以「大數據分析應用」為教學特色，並為企業識別學士專長的評斷依據。依此發展目標，將探討大數據原理、分析方法及應用方向，並融入土地管理。",
    "describe_eh": "This course intends to take \"Analysis and Application of Big Data\" as the teaching feature and provide the basis for the degree. In accordance with this development goal, the principles, analysis methods and application of big dada will be explored, and incorporated into land management.",
